{{ define "main" }}
  <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Sorry, the service is currently unavailable</h1>
  <p class="govuk-body">If your deputy report is due today, it can be submitted once the service is back online.</p>
  <p class="govuk-body">If you need to talk to someone about your Complete the deputy report account, contact us by:</p>
  <p class="govuk-body">Email: <a class="govuk-link" href="mailto:customerservices@publicguardian.gov.uk">customerservices@publicguardian.gov.uk</a>
      <br>Telephone: 0300 123 1300
      <br>Relay UK (if you cannot hear or speak on the phone): 18001 0300 123 1300
      <br>Monday to Friday, 9:00am to 5pm, except Wednesday, 10am to 5pm.
      <br><a class="govuk-link" href="https://www.gov.uk/call-charges">Find out about call charges</a>
  </p>
  <p class="govuk-body">Back to GOV.UK: <a class="govuk-link" href="https://www.gov.uk/become-deputy/complete-your-deputy-report">www.gov.uk/become-deputy/complete-your-deputy-report</a>
  </p>
